 {'clause':'Full raw composition equivalence and all pair coverage','assessment':'gapCompositionEquiv composes the exact whole-span raw composition/cut-set equivalence, the proved physical gap-cut equivalence, and both inverse gap composition/cut-set equivalences. Its range is the entire Cartesian product of all left and right raw compositions. Explicit left/right cut lemmas expose the two closed-interval filters; the inverse cut lemma exposes the literal union. Since the sorted cut-set representation is proved equivalent to the unchanged raw composition type, this identifies actual ordered cut lists and their arities, not only abstract cardinalities. Independent consumers check the exact union membership of every physical position, both separate unary-gap roundtrips with the other gap arbitrary, and full finite cardinality of the Cartesian-product domain.'},
